<area shape="rect" id="node10" title="ddd.models.objects.Map

A two dimensional calibratable table, stored as ``[y][x]``.
" alt="" coords="1728,1299,2325,1775"/>
<area shape="rect" id="node11" title="ddd.models.objects.Measurement

An online value: written by the software, only measured by the calibration tool.
